{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Shadow Surge|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Vex
|skill        = R
|icon         = Vex Shadow Surge.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Vex}} sends her ''Shadow'' in the target direction, which deals {{as|magic damage}} to enemies hit. ''Shadow'' stops upon hitting an enemy {{tip|champion}}, marking and {{tip|true sight|revealing}} them for a few seconds.<br/>''Shadow Surge'' can be recast while the target is marked.
|blurb2       = {{sbc|Recast:}} '''Vex''' {{tip|dashes}} towards the marked target. Upon arrival, the mark is consumed to deal {{as|magic damage}} to the target.
|blurb3       = If '''Vex''' scores a {{tip|takedown}} against the marked target within a few seconds of the mark's application, she can cast ''Shadow Surge'' again within some time, repeating the effects.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Vex''' sends her ''Shadow'' in the target direction, which grants {{tip|sight}} around its {{tt|trajectory|Does not see into brush or across terrain}} and deals {{as|magic damage}} to enemies hit.
|leveling     = {{st|Magic Damage|{{ap|75 to 175}} {{as|(+ 20% AP)}}}}
|description2 = ''Shadow'' stops upon hitting an enemy {{tip|champion}} to mark them for 4 seconds, during which they are {{tip|true sight|revealed}}. ''Shadow Surge'' can be recast while the target is marked.
|icon3        = Vex Shadow Surge 2.png
|description3 = {{sbc|Recast:}} '''Vex''' {{tip|dashes}} towards the marked target with {{tip|displacement immunity}}. Upon arrival, she consumes their mark and deals {{as|magic damage}}.
|leveling3    = {{st|Magic Damage|{{ap|150 to 350}} {{as|(+ 50% AP)}}|Total Magic Damage|{{ap|75+150 to 175+350}} {{as|(+ {{ap|20+50}}% AP)}}}}
|description4 = If '''Vex''' scores a {{tip|takedown}} against ''Shadow Surge's'' marked target within 8 seconds of its application, '''Vex''' can cast ''Shadow Surge'' again within 12 seconds at no cost after {{fd|0.5}} seconds, repeating the effects.
|cooldown     = {{tt|{{ap|140 to 100}}|Starts post-effect of initial cast}}
|cdstart      = post-effect
|cast time    = {{dv|{{tt|{{fd|0.25}}|Active}}|{{tt|None|Recast}}}}
|cost         = 100
